title: herb-target-screening
type: software
message: >-
  If you use this software in your research, please cite it
  using the metadata below.
  如果你在研究中使用了本工具，请按以下元数据引用。
authors:
  - given-names: "wangshubo1578"          # ← 发布前改成你的名字
    website: "https://github.com/wangshubo1578"   # ← 改成你的 GitHub 主页
abstract: >-
  A Claude Code / CodeBuddy Agent Skill for reverse screening of
  traditional Chinese medicine (TCM) monomer compounds against a
  given protein target. It searches HERB and TCMSP, cleans and
  deduplicates candidates, runs batch molecular docking with
  AutoDock Vina, and reports ADMET properties and clinical trials
  of the best hit.
keywords:
  - traditional-chinese-medicine
  - molecular-docking
  - drug-discovery
  - network-pharmacology
  - bioinformatics
  - autodock-vina
